Package: onward-vms
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OneWard VMS Contributors <mo.armoun@gmail.com>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/yourorg/onward-vms
Description: OneWard VMS — pipeline-driven video management system
 A Rust-native video management system built around a composable pipeline DAG.
 Records RTSP camera streams as chunked MP4 files, with automatic reconnection
 and per-credential AES-256-GCM encryption at rest.
 .
 This package installs the community edition daemon (vms-daemon) and a systemd
 unit file. An encryption key must be set in /etc/onward/env before the service
 can start.
Depends: libgstreamer1.0-0 (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-base (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-good (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad (>= 1.20),
         gstreamer1.0-libav (>= 1.20),
         libssl3,
         ca-certificates,
         libsqlite3-0,
         systemd
